COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.allocate_inventory_for_order(p_order_id uuid) IS 'Allocates inventory for D2H/S2D orders from orders.fulfillment_warehouse_id (or legacy-resolved source) and confirms the resolved stock configuration on the order line, so a submitted order is approvable without a separate manual confirmation. Movement shows warehouse location with per-order allocation (Before: 0, After: qty). Idempotent per variant allocation row.';


